# Root-level ignores — backend/, frontend/, and mobile/ each have their own more specific
# .gitignore for their own build output and dependencies. This one only covers things that can
# show up anywhere in the repo: personal editor state and OS cruft, never meant to be committed.

# JetBrains (IntelliJ/WebStorm/etc.) — personal project state, not shared config
.idea/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Local env files
.env
.env.local
